74
00:02:39.600 --> 00:02:41.390
times the square root of 3.

75
00:02:41.390 --> 00:02:43.190
The reason it's interesting to do it this way,

76
00:02:43.190 --> 00:02:45.050
is because now at this point we can say

77
00:02:45.050 --> 00:02:47.060
that the square root of 6 in the numerator

78
00:02:47.060 --> 00:02:48.500
