79
00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:49.470
in the denominator.

80
00:02:49.470 --> 00:02:51.030
Square root of 6 over square root of 6

81
00:02:51.030 --> 00:02:53.240
is equal to 1, so really we just have

82
00:02:53.240 --> 00:02:56.090
1 times square root of 4 over the square root of 3.

83
00:02:56.090 --> 00:02:57.870
Those two cancel with each other,

84
00:02:57.870 --> 00:02:59.430
and we're just left with square root of 4

85
00:02:59.430 --> 00:03:00.640
over square root of 3.

86
00:03:00.640 --> 00:03:02.790
Now we know that the square root of 4 is 2.

87
00:03:02.790 --> 00:03:04.860
So we can simplify the numerator and say

88
00:03:04.860 --> 00:03:07.490
2 over the square root of 3.

89
00:03:07.490 --> 00:03:09.250
