00:03:11.299 --> 00:03:13.998
but as a rule, you never want to leave a square root

92
00:03:13.998 --> 00:03:16.650
in the denominator of your final answer.

93
00:03:16.650 --> 00:03:18.510
So the way that we get the square root out

94
00:03:18.510 --> 00:03:19.720
