102
00:03:34.720 --> 00:03:36.380
But when we do this, we're going to get

103
00:03:36.380 --> 00:03:38.265
in the denominator when we multiply across

104
00:03:38.265 --> 00:03:41.210
the square root of 3 times the square root of 3,

105
00:03:41.210 --> 00:03:43.570
which will be the whole number 3.

106
00:03:43.570 --> 00:03:48.270
So then our final answer becomes 2 root 3 over 3.

107
00:03:48.270 --> 00:03:50.370
